1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,020
Cloud computing lets small businesses rent
powerful servers instead of buying them.

2
00:00:05,380 --> 00:00:08,730
Their files are stored
safely in large data centers.

3
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:12,420
Teams can work together from
anywhere with an internet connection,

4
00:00:12,740 --> 00:00:16,580
and when the business grows, it
simply rents more computing power.
